    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are vertices of a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>△</mo><mi>ABC</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>AB</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>AC</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>AC</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>AC</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AD</mi></math> is the angle bisector of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∠</mo><mi>BAC</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mi>AB</mi><mi>AC</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>BD</mi><mi>CD</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>BD</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>CD</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0077_7d81ee3cc2a9.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 250px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> is midpoint of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BC</mi></math></p><p>So, using mid-point formula,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>AD</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>81</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>45</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>45</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math></p>"
  }
}